[k] 方案: 跨机运维代理（agent）——服务端 + 客户端 + 守护自启 + 断线重连，全部代码分 3 部分交付

架构：客户端主动外连 WebSocket 长连接（NAT 友好、断线自动指数退避重连），服务端同时挂 HTTP API（文件上传下载）与 `/stream` MJPEG 实时屏幕流。鉴权用共享 TOKEN。

═══ Part 1/3 · 服务端 server.py ═══

```python
# server.py  —— 运维代理服务端
# 依赖: pip install fastapi uvicorn python-multipart pillow
# 运行: python server.py --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8443 --token YOUR_TOKEN
import argparse, asyncio, json, time, uuid, os, hashlib
from typing import Dict, Optional
from fastapi import FastAPI, WebSocket, WebSocketDisconnect, Request, UploadFile, File, Header, HTTPException
from fastapi.responses import StreamingResponse, Response, JSONResponse
import uvicorn

TOKEN = ""
clients: Dict[str, "AgentConn"] = {}          # agent_id -> 连接
pending: Dict[str, asyncio.Future] = {}        # request_id -> future
file_store = "/data/agentfs"                   # 上传暂存目录

class AgentConn:
    def __init__(self, ws: WebSocket, agent_id: str):
        self.ws, self.agent_id = ws, agent_id
        self.online_at = time.time()
        self.last_seen = time.time()
        self.meta = {}
        self.lock = asyncio.Lock()
    async def call(self, action: str, params: dict, timeout: float = 30.0) -> dict:
        rid = str(uuid.uuid4())
        fut = asyncio.get_running_loop().create_future()
        pending[rid] = fut
        try:
            async with self.lock:
                await self.ws.send_text(json.dumps({"t": "req", "id": rid, "action": action, "params": params}))
            return await asyncio.wait_for(fut, timeout)
        finally:
            pending.pop(rid, None)

app = FastAPI(title="ops-agent-server")

def auth(x_token: str = Header(default="")):
    if x_token != TOKEN:
        raise HTTPException(401, "bad token")

# ---------- 鉴权中间件（WebSocket 用 query token） ----------
@app.middleware("http")
async def mw(request: Request, call_next):
    if request.url.path in ("/ws",):
        if request.query_params.get("token") != TOKEN:
            return JSONResponse({"error": "bad token"}, 401)
    elif not request.url.path.startswith(("/docs", "/openapi.json")):
        if request.headers.get("x-token", "") != TOKEN:
            return JSONResponse({"error": "bad token"}, 401)
    return await call_next(request)

# ---------- 长连接入口 ----------
@app.websocket("/ws")
async def ws_entry(ws: WebSocket):
    agent_id = ws.query_params.get("id") or str(uuid.uuid4())[:8]
    await ws.accept()
    conn = AgentConn(ws, agent_id)
    clients[agent_id] = conn
    print(f"[+] {agent_id} online")
    try:
        await ws.send_text(json.dumps({"t": "hello", "server": time.time(), "agents": list(clients)}))
        while True:
            raw = await ws.receive_text()
            conn.last_seen = time.time()
            try:
                msg = json.loads(raw)
            except Exception:
                continue
            t = msg.get("t")
            if t == "resp" and msg.get("id") in pending:
                fut = pending[msg["id"]]
                if not fut.done():
                    fut.set_result(msg.get("data", {}))
            elif t == "meta":
                conn.meta = msg.get("data", {})
            elif t == "event" and msg.get("action") == "screen":
                conn.meta["screen"] = msg.get("data")   # 最新一帧 base64 JPEG
    except WebSocketDisconnect:
        pass
    finally:
        clients.pop(agent_id, None)
        for rid, fut in list(pending.items()):
            if not fut.done():
                fut.set_exception(ConnectionError("agent offline"))
        print(f"[-] {agent_id} offline")

# ---------- 管理 API ----------
@app.get("/api/agents")
def agents():
    return [{"id": c.agent_id, "online": True, "since": c.online_at,
             "last_seen": c.last_seen, "meta": c.meta} for c in clients.values()]

def get(agent_id: str) -> AgentConn:
    if agent_id not in clients:
        raise HTTPException(404, "agent offline")
    return clients[agent_id]

# 远程执行 cmd
@app.post("/api/exec/{agent_id}")
async def api_exec(agent_id: str, request: Request):
    body = await request.json()
    r = await get(agent_id).call("exec", {"cmd": body.get("cmd", ""), "timeout": body.get("timeout", 60)}, timeout=body.get("timeout", 60) + 5)
    return r

# 远程执行（shell）
@app.post("/api/exec_sh/{agent_id}")
async def api_exec_sh(agent_id: str, request: Request):
    body = await request.json()
    return await get(agent_id).call("exec_sh", {"cmd": body.get("cmd", ""), "timeout": body.get("timeout", 60)}, timeout=body.get("timeout", 60) + 5)

# 目录列表
@app.get("/api/fs/{agent_id}/list")
async def fs_list(agent_id: str, path: str = "/"):
    return await get(agent_id).call("fs_list", {"path": path})

# 下载（服务端从 agent 拉取并流给调用方）
@app.get("/api/fs/{agent_id}/download")
async def fs_download(agent_id: str, path: str):
    conn = get(agent_id)
    r = await conn.call("fs_read", {"path": path, "chunk": 1024 * 1024}, timeout=120)
    if not r.get("ok"):
        raise HTTPException(400, r.get("err", "read fail"))
    data = __import__("base64").b64decode(r["b64"])
    name = os.path.basename(path)
    return Response(data, media_type="application/octet-stream",
                    headers={"Content-Disposition": f'attachment; filename="{name}"'})

# 上传（调用方 POST -> 服务端转发给 agent 落盘）
@app.post("/api/fs/{agent_id}/upload")
async def fs_upload(agent_id: str, file: UploadFile = File(...), path: str = ""):
    raw = await file.read()
    dest = path or f"/tmp/{file.filename}"
    r = await get(agent_id).call("fs_write", {"path": dest, "b64": __import__("base64").b64encode(raw).decode(),
                                              "append": False}, timeout=300)
    return {"dest": dest, "size": len(raw), **r}

# 实时屏幕：MJPEG 持续推流（浏览器直接 <img src=...>）
@app.get("/api/screen/{agent_id}")
async def screen(agent_id: str):
    conn = get(agent_id)
    async def gen():
        last = b""
        while agent_id in clients:
            b64 = clients[agent_id].meta.get("screen")
            if b64:
                import base64
                frame = base64.b64decode(b64)
                if frame != last:
                    last = frame
                    yield (b"--frame\r\nContent-Type: image/jpeg\r\nContent-Length: "
                           + str(len(frame)).encode() + b"\r\n\r\n" + frame + b"\r\n")
            await asyncio.sleep(0.05)
    return StreamingResponse(gen(), media_type="multipart/x-mixed-replace; boundary=frame")

# 截一帧
@app.get("/api/screenshot/{agent_id}")
async def screenshot(agent_id: str):
    return await get(agent_id).call("screenshot", {}, timeout=15)

if __name__ == "__main__":
    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser()
    ap.add_argument("--host", default="0.0.0.0")
    ap.add_argument("--port", type=int, default=8443)
    ap.add_argument("--token", required=True)
    a = ap.parse_args()
    TOKEN = a.token
    os.makedirs(file_store, exist_ok=True)
    uvicorn.run(app, host=a.host, port=a.port, log_level="info")
```

